        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8-2 Teachers, other than ones newly-appointed, shall, if possible, be shown their proposed programs for the coming school year, including the schools to which they will be assigned, the grade levels and/or subjects they will teach, before the school year ends, or earlier; and any subsequent change in grade or level assignment in the elementary schools and in subject assignment in the secondary schools shall be made with full knowledge of the teacher.",
